#  2024  #

##########
fugitive-name = Fugitive
fugitive-desc = An escaped prisoner whose goal is to survive.
planet-prison-name = Planetary Prison
planet-prison-desc = A prison located on a planet, operating as a standalone station.
cyborg-update-name = Station Cyborgs
cyborg-update-desc = New cyborg units.
collective-mind-name = Collective Mind
collective-mind-desc = A system allowing certain creatures to communicate telepathically, provided they possess a collective consciousness.
syndicate-cyborgs-name = New Syndicate Cyborgs
syndicate-cyborgs-desc = More advanced and useful cyborg units for the Syndicate.
new-guns-name = Firearm Expansion
new-guns-desc = The addition of a diverse range of firearms (and what about flamethrowers?).
smart-viruse-name = Sentient Disease
smart-viruse-desc = An antagonist whose goal is to infect the station with a disease.
cargo-rework-name = Cargo Rework
cargo-rework-desc = Removal of the trading outpost and cargo shuttle; implementation of buying and selling directly on the station.
new-maps-name = Global Map Overhaul
new-maps-desc = Significant improvements and revisions to existing maps (Delta, Box).
fully-translating-name = Complete Translation
fully-translating-desc = Translation of all items and menus, aimed at simplifying gameplay.
night-vision-name = Night Vision
night-vision-desc = Night Vision Goggles (NVGs), and innate night vision capabilities for certain animals/races.
ipc-name = IPC
ipc-desc = A race of sentient machines; currently undergoing a rework.
blob-name = The Blob
blob-desc = An antagonist whose goal is to consume—and thereby destroy—the station. assault-ops-name = Sabotage Squad
assault-ops-desc = A squad of mercenaries tasked with covertly carrying out acts of sabotage on the station, disrupting its operations.
ert-call-name = ERT Call Console
ert-call-desc = A console used to summon the Emergency Response Team (ERT).
ussp-name = USSP Station
ussp-desc = A standalone USSP station with its own specific objectives for the shift.
vent-crawling-name = Vent Crawling
vent-crawling-desc = Enables small creatures and various antagonists to move through the station's ventilation system.
flesh-cult-name = Flesh Cult
flesh-cult-desc = A Flesh Cult whose goal is to destroy the station.
blood-cult-name = Blood Cult (Nar'Si, Pir'kus, The Reaper)
blood-cult-desc = A cult devoted to the god Nar'Si; the cult's objective is to summon their patron deity, who will subsequently destroy the station.
economy-name = Economy
economy-desc = Introduces money and salaries; the mail system now issues funds, while vending machines require payment for food.
extend-med-name = Medical Department Expansion
extend-med-desc = Adds new mechanics and roles to the Medical Department.
pathologist-name = Pathologist
pathologist-desc = A new role within the Medical Department, tasked with overseeing the morgue.
arena-name = Ghost Arena
arena-desc = An arena where ghosts can pass the time instead of aimlessly floating around the station while waiting for the round to end.
limbo-name = Limbo
limbo-desc = A separate pocket dimension for ghosts where no rules apply.
taipan-name = Taipan
taipan-desc = A standalone Syndicate station with its own specific objectives for the shift. ##########

#  2025  #

##########
mail-name = Mail
mail-desc = Sending packages to various parts of the station, for which the station receives payment.
mechs-name = Mechs
mechs-desc = Piloted mechs designed for work in hazardous environments, as well as for facilitating cargo transport and other tasks that humans cannot handle alone.
ai-name = AI
ai-desc = A new Artificial Intelligence role—is it aimed at helping the station... destroy itself?
borer-name = Brain Borer
borer-desc = An antagonist that burrows into the brains of living creatures and takes control of their minds.
lavaland-name = Lavaland
lavaland-desc = A separate dimension where miners extract resources for the station.
angels-name = Angel Race
angels-desc = A new race of angels, each possessing their own unique abilities.
impids-name = Impid Race
impids-desc = A new race of Impids, evolved in harsh and scorching environments.
skills-name = Skill System
skills-desc = A system that prevents you from performing specific actions unless you possess the required skill.
space-fight-name = Space Battle Mode
space-fight-desc = An exciting new game mode that immerses you in a world of interstellar warfare.
spider-terror-name = Terror Spiders
spider-terror-desc = The result of Syndicate experiments involving the crossbreeding of giant space spider DNA with that of a Xenomorph.
wizards-name = Wizards Mode
wizards-desc = A game mode in which a wizard spawns and proceeds to wreak havoc.
morph-name = Morph
morph-desc = A mass of green flesh with the ability to assume the physical appearance of any human. diseases-name = Diseases
diseases-desc = A revitalization of virology—you can now actually contract AIDS, just like Sonic.
plasmamens-name = Plasmamen Race
plasmamens-desc = A race of cool plasma dudes.
centcomm-update-name = CentComm Update
centcomm-update-desc = An update to the Central Command map, and potentially new roles.
